        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Background\n",
        "\n",
        "In wall-bounded turbulent flows, the mean streamwise velocity near the wall\n",
        "follows universal scaling laws when expressed in *viscous (wall) units*:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "u^+ = \\frac{\\bar{u}}{u_\\tau}, \\qquad\n",
        "y^+ = \\frac{y \\, u_\\tau}{\\nu}, \\qquad\n",
        "u_\\tau = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\tau_w}{\\rho}}\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "Two regions are of particular interest:\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Viscous sublayer** ($y^+ \\lesssim 5$): $\\; u^+ = y^+$\n",
        "- **Log-law region** ($y^+ \\gtrsim 30$): $\\; u^+ = \\frac{1}{\\kappa} \\ln y^+ + B$\n",
        "\n",
        "with $\\kappa \\approx 0.41$ and $B \\approx 5.2$.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Python post-processing example\n",
        "\n",
        "The cell below builds a composite mean-velocity profile (Spalding's law)\n",
        "and compares it to the two limiting behaviours. Run it yourself — you will\n",
        "adapt this code in the tasks."
      ],
      "id": "090211e7"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| label: fig-law-of-the-wall\n",
        "#| fig-cap: 'Law of the wall: Spalding''s composite profile vs. the viscous sublayer and log law.'\n",
        "import numpy as np\n",
        "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
        "\n",
        "kappa, B = 0.41, 5.2\n",
        "\n",
        "# Spalding's law gives y+ as a function of u+ (implicit profile)\n",
        "u_plus = np.linspace(0.01, 25, 400)\n",
        "y_plus = u_plus + np.exp(-kappa * B) * (\n",
        "    np.exp(kappa * u_plus) - 1 - kappa * u_plus\n",
        "    - (kappa * u_plus) ** 2 / 2 - (kappa * u_plus) ** 3 / 6\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(7, 4.5))\n",
        "ax.semilogx(y_plus, u_plus, \"k-\", lw=2, label=\"Spalding (composite)\")\n",
        "\n",
        "yp = np.logspace(-1, 1.2, 50)\n",
        "ax.semilogx(yp, yp, \"b--\", label=r\"$u^+ = y^+$ (viscous sublayer)\")\n",
        "\n",
        "yp = np.logspace(1, 3.5, 50)\n",
        "ax.semilogx(yp, np.log(yp) / kappa + B, \"r--\",\n",
        "            label=r\"$u^+ = \\frac{1}{\\kappa}\\ln y^+ + B$ (log law)\")\n",
        "\n",
        "ax.set_xlabel(r\"$y^+$\")\n",
        "ax.set_ylabel(r\"$u^+$\")\n",
        "ax.set_xlim(0.1, 3000)\n",
        "ax.set_ylim(0, 27)\n",
        "ax.legend()\n",
        "ax.grid(alpha=0.3, which=\"both\")\n",
        "plt.tight_layout()\n",
        "plt.show()"
      ],
      "id": "fig-law-of-the-wall",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
